 **Inputs and Outputs:**
-- **Input:** Octree root node, scalar field values, and configuration parameters [S1, unofficial].
-- **Output:** Isosurface mesh (vertices and triangles) [S1, unofficial].
+*   **Input:** An octree data structure representing the scalar field, an isovalue threshold, and configuration parameters.
+*   **Output:** A mesh (vertices and indices) generated by the underlying Marching Cubes implementation.
 
