+Hierarchical Marching Cubes Enumeration is part of the "planaria/dmc" project [S1, unofficial]. It is an unofficial implementation that adapts the classic Marching Cubes algorithm to work efficiently with octree data structures. The method is designed to extract isosurfaces from volumetric data represented by an octree, leveraging the hierarchical nature of the data to optimize traversal and mesh generation.
 
